    "body": "We used an offline VM running a copy of our Agie Classic Cut 2S machine control. In the dependent native-post work, CAMCraft used this template to prepare the synthetic punch. The control imported its geometry and job files and plotted the rough cut and trims. CAMCraft tests separately checked the template’s machine data and its refusal when the cutting condition was missing.\n\nAll controller runs were offline. No physical cut was made.\n",
